feat(diagram-core): optional href on Terminal/Token for clickable nodes

Add a defaulted `href: Option<String>` field plus a `with_href` builder to
`Terminal` and `Token`, mirroring `NonTerminal`. When set, `svg::to_railroad`
wraps the rendered box in a `railroad::Link` (an `<a href>` anchor) via a new
shared `link_or` helper now used by all three leaf arms. Geometry is
unaffected; existing `::new(text)` call sites keep working.
